[{"code":"list_still_used","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":27,"col":22},"end":{"line":27,"col":30}},"title":"LIST CHANGED WHILE STILL IN USE","message":"`Response` must return a list it owns, but Cmd.task sends what it returns, and\nit returns what Cmd.task hands it, which may be a list the sender still holds.\n\n27|            ( model, Cmd.task (λ⊤ → page.errors) Response )\n                        ^^^^^^^^ the function is handed on here\n\nHave the function return a list it owns: a new list, or a copy made with\n`List.copy`.\n\nThis is sharing the checker can see: Cmd.task sends what it returns, and it\nreturns what Cmd.task hands it, which may be a list the sender still holds."}]
